gs\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Folds a monadic function over `Fin n` from right to left, starting with `n-1`.\n\nIt is the sequence of steps:\n```\nFin.foldrM n f xₙ = do\n  let xₙ₋₁ ← f (n-1) xₙ\n  let xₙ₋₂ ← f (n-2) xₙ₋₁\n  ...\n  let x₀ ← f 0 x₁\n  pure x₀\n```\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldrM","kind":"def","line":83,"name":"Fin.foldrM","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Fin/Fold.lean#L83-L111"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldlM\"><span class=\"name\">Fin</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldlM</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1 → <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Monad\">Monad</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">init</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Folds a monadic function over all the values in `Fin n` from left to right, starting with `0`.\n\nIt is the sequence of steps:\n```\nFin.foldlM n f x₀ = do\n  let x₁ ← f x₀ 0\n  let x₂ ← f x₁ 1\n  ...\n  let xₙ ← f xₙ₋₁ (n-1)\n  pure xₙ\n```\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldlM","kind":"def","line":54,"name":"Fin.foldlM","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Fin/Fold.lean#L54-L81"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldr.loop\"><span class=\"name\">Fin</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldr</span>.<span class=\"name\">loop</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Sort</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Inner loop for `Fin.foldr`. `Fin.foldr.loop n f i x = f 0 (f ... (f (i-1) x))`  ","docLink":"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldr.loop","kind":"def","line":49,"name":"Fin.foldr.loop","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Fin/Fold.lean#L49-L51"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldr\"><span class=\"name\">Fin</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldr</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Sort</a> u_1}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">init</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Combine all the values that can be represented by `Fin n` with an initial value, starting at `n - 1`\nand nesting to the right.\n\nExample:\n * `Fin.foldr 3 (·.val + ·) (0 : Nat) = (0 : Fin 3).val + ((1 : Fin 3).val + ((2 : Fin 3).val + 0))`\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Fin/Fold.html#Fin.foldr","kind":"def","line":40,"name":"Fin.foldr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/470d5ce1400764999581fd26d5d72b00d990b0f4/src/Init/Data/Fin/Fold.lean#L40-L52"}},{